RELAXED_BOX 71.9443969791445 71.943200332824 71.9429033970192

# These formulas define the derivatives w.r.t. strain components
# Constants uses $, variables use v_
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-${pxx0})/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-169.809773607399)/(v_delta/v_len0)*${cfac}
variable d1 equal -(v_pxx1-169.809773607399)/(v_delta/v_len0)*0.0001
